WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Choose a primary key

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
List the columns that could identify a row.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.220
Reject any column whose value can repeat or be missing.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:17.710
Prefer a stable identifier. Reference it from related tables using a foreign key.

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:25.730
Two students can share a name. A school-issued student ID can uniquely identify each row in the student table.
